.TH PATINA-PANEL 1 "2026-10-18" "patina-desktop 0.1.0" "Patina Desktop"
.SH NAME
patina-panel \- top panel of the Patina desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B patina-panel
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B patina-panel
draws the 36 pixel panel along the top edge of the screen as a layer-shell client of the
compositor: launcher button, workspace buttons, the title of the active app, a clock, and
status icons.
It is normally started by
.BR patina-session (1).
.SH BUGS
Live: the clock (local time, redrawn on the minute), the battery level (only on machines with a
battery), the title of the focused window, and the workspace buttons, which switch workspaces.
The launcher button, the status icons and the notification bell do not do anything yet, and the
status icons do not show real state: the launcher, quick settings and a notification service are
not part of this pre-release.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B WGPU_BACKEND
Graphics API. Use
.B gl
in virtual machines and on machines without a Vulkan driver.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR patina-session (1),
.BR patina-compositor (1)
